-- Smash history: the sets of 2008-2010 Brawl majors, read by hand from Liquipedia's bracket pages (round 734's way;
-- Matthew, 2026-11-22: "Continue"). Liquipedia keeps the later rounds of most of these brackets, not every set; EVO
-- 2009 and GENESIS have only their last two rounds. Scores as Liquipedia lists them; forfeits left out. One page typo
-- fixed (Pound 4: "Mew2Kiong" is Mew2King). Made with tools/liquipedia/bracket-to-sql.mjs from
-- tools/liquipedia/brackets/2008-2010-brawl.txt. Safe to run twice.

-- manual/2009-evo-2009 (brawl): 2 sets, from https://liquipedia.net/smash/EVO/2009/Singles_Bracket
on conflict (set_id) do update set round = excluded.round, sort_order = excluded.sort_order, p1_name = excluded.p1_name,
  p1_score = excluded.p1_score, p2_name = excluded.p2_name, p2_score = excluded.p2_score, winner = excluded.winner;

